      <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold" style="font-size: 3.2vw; text-align: center">About ChemAR</h1>
      <p class="text-center">
          <br> The Chemical Augmented Reality Project is an innovative web application designed to provide users with an immersive experience by enabling the visualization of 3D molecular models through Augmented Reality (AR). 
          Leveraging the AR.js library, this application adeptly detects markers and seamlessly presents captivating 3D models directly within the user's web browser. 
          These dynamic models are generated from .mol files, meticulously designed to emulate the classic "ball and stick" molecular representation, 
          ensuring both accuracy and familiarity for users engaging with chemical structures. <br><br><br>
      </p>

